{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18737","headline":"百花行 · 刘禹锡","name":"百花行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安百花时，风景宜轻薄。\n无人不沽酒，何处不闻乐。\n春风连夜动，微雨凌晓濯。\n红焰出墙头，雪光映楼角。\n繁紫韵松竹，远黄绕篱落。\n临路不胜愁，轻烟去何托。\n满庭荡魂魄，照庑成丹渥。\n烂熳簇颠狂，飘零劝行乐。\n时节易晼晚，清阴覆池阁。\n唯有安石榴，当轩慰寂寞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}